sentences.text:
The sentence imposed by the learned Principal Civil Judge and Judicial Magistrate First Class, Vaghodiya, in Criminal Case No.1791 of 1997 dated 4.6.2015, and confirmed by learned 3rd Additional District and Sessions Judge,
Vadodara, At Savli vide judgment and order passed in Criminal Appeal No.30 of 2015 dated 14.2.2017, are hereby suspended and the applicant shall be released on regular bail on their executing personal bond of Rs.10,000/- (Rupees Ten Thousand only) each and one surety of like amount to the satisfaction of the Trial Court and subject to the conditions that he shall;
(a) surrender passport, if any, to the lower court within a week;
(b) not leave the State of Gujarat without prior permission of the Trial Court;
(c) furnish the present address of residence to the I.O. and also HC-NIC Page 2 of 3 Created On Wed Feb 22 00:55:30 IST 2017 R/CR.MA/5227/2017 ORDER to the Court at the time of execution of the bond and shall not change the residence without prior permission of this Court;
Rule is made absolute to the aforesaid extent.

